## Images and Media :badge[Enhanced]{variant="tip"}

### Automatic Image Zoom

All images in `.mdoc` files are automatically zoomable. Click any image to view full-screen:

```markdown
![Alt text description](../../../assets/image.jpg)
![Diagram](/diagrams/architecture.drawio.svg)
```

Features:
- Click to zoom
- Escape key to close
- Alt text shown as caption
- Keyboard accessible
- Works with all image formats

